== St. Laurent Complex schedule_changes "Drop-in schedule - swim and aquafitness"
- IGNORED date-context "Monday, September 7"
    at: group "Drop-in schedule - swim and aquafitness"
- NOTICE "See Labour Day schedule."
    date text: "Monday, September 7"
    dates: 2026-09-07 Mon
    effects: see-schedule "Labour Day schedule"
    match: SCOPE_PHRASE
    at: group "Drop-in schedule - swim and aquafitness"

== St. Laurent Complex special_hours
- NOTICE "Monday, September 7, 8 am to 6 pm"
    date text: "Monday, September 7"
    dates: 2026-09-07 Mon
    time: "8 am to 6 pm" 08:00-18:00 unchecked
    effects: modified-hours
    at: facility
- IGNORED heading "Closure"
    section: "Closure"
    at: facility
- NOTICE "The pool's wheelchair ramp is currently unavailable. We apologize for the inconvenience."
    section: "Closure"
    effects: closure
    match: NONE
    phrase: "pool's wheelchair ramp"
    amenity: "pool's wheelchair ramp"
    at: facility
